        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/wardogs-review-header.png?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>It took me four attempts to successfully parachute into a Wardogs match. On the first try, I opened my parachute far too early, and was promptly sniped from the sky by one of the many sharpshooters that populate Wardogs' battlefield. The second time, I pulled the ripcord far too late, pancaking into the ground like a camo-clad Wile-E-Coyote. The third time, I pulled the cord only <em>slightly </em>too late. But it turns out \"slightly too late\" has the same outcome as \"very too late\" when it comes to parachute jumping.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/wardogs-early-access-review\">Read more</a></p>",
